いつもどおりのある日のこと 君は突然立ち上がった
Just like any other ordinary day, you suddenly stood up

162
00:21:43,792 --> 00:21:49,092
今夜 星を見に行こう
Tonight, let's go see the stars.

163
00:21:49,692 --> 00:21:53,742
[Title: 君の知らない物語]

164
00:22:06,792 --> 00:22:12,392
たまにはいいこと言うんだね なんてみんなして言って笑った
You actually said something nice for once, everyone laughed and said

165
00:22:13,092 --> 00:22:18,092
明かりもない道を進む
Walking down a road without even a light

166
00:22:18,792 --> 00:22:31,092
バカみたいにはしゃいですぐ歩いた 抱え込んだ孤独や不安に 押し潰されないように
Walking and frolicking like fools, trying not to be crushed by the loneliness and anxiety we held inside

167
00:22:33,442 --> 00:22:38,792
真っ暗な世界から見上げた
Looking up from a pitch-black world

168
00:22:39,242 --> 00:22:45,592
夜空は星が降るようで
The night sky looked like it was raining stars

169
00:22:48,392 --> 00:22:57,092
いつからだろう 君のことを追いかける私がいいた ドキッとね願い抑えないで
Since when was I chasing after you? My heart skipped a beat, don't hold back that wish

170
00:22:57,692 --> 00:23:06,092
驚かないで聞いてよ 私のこの思いを
Don't be surprised, just listen to these feelings of mine

171
00:23:12,442 --> 00:23:19,092
あれがデネブ アルタイル ベガ 君は指さす夏の大三角
That's Deneb, Altair, Vega—you point out the Summer Triangle

172
00:23:25,792 --> 00:23:31,092
覚えて空を見る
Remembering it, I look up at the sky

173
00:23:31,692 --> 00:23:37,092
やっと見つけた織姫様 だけどどこだろう彦星様
At last I found Princess Orihime, but where could Prince Hikoboshi be?

174
00:23:37,492 --> 00:23:44,392
これじゃひとりぼっち
At this rate, I'm all alone

175
00:23:45,392 --> 00:23:51,392
楽しげなひとつ隣の君 私には何も言えなくて
You, happily chatting right beside me, while I couldn't say a thing

176
00:23:58,792 --> 00:24:05,392
本当はずっと君のことを
The truth is, all this time

177
00:24:05,792 --> 00:24:13,092
どこかで分かっていた 見つかったって届きはしない
I knew somewhere inside, even if you were found, it wouldn't reach you

178
00:24:13,492 --> 00:24:19,092
だめだよ 泣かないで
No, don't cry

179
00:24:24,592 --> 00:24:32,092
そう言い聞かせた
That's what I told myself

180
00:24:32,792 --> 00:24:38,592
強がる私は臆病で 興味がないようなふりをしてた
Pretending to be strong, I acted cowardly, pretending not to care

181
00:24:43,392 --> 00:24:49,592
胸を刺した痛みは増してく ああ好きになるとこういうことなのね
The pain stabbing my chest only grows—ah, so this is what it means to fall in love

182
00:25:25,407 --> 00:25:36,187
どうしたい？言えなかった　心の声がする
What did I want? I couldn't say it... My heart's voice is calling out...

183
00:25:37,487 --> 00:25:43,447
君のとなりがいい　切ないほど
I want to be by your side, it's so painful...

184
00:25:44,187 --> 00:25:48,567
秘密　夜を越えて　遠い思い出の
A secret, crossing the night, far-away memories...

185
00:25:49,967 --> 00:25:57,707
言えなかった　言えなかった　二度と戻れない
I couldn't say it, I couldn't say it, we can never go back...

186
00:26:01,267 --> 00:26:07,867
あの夏の日のきらめく星　今でも思い出せるよ
That glittering star of summer days, I can still remember it now...

187
00:26:12,867 --> 00:26:18,967
笑った顔も　怒った顔も　大好きでした
Even your smiling face, even your angry face, I loved them all...

188
00:26:24,867 --> 00:26:34,967
おかしよね　わかってたのに　君の知らない私だけの秘密
It's funny, even though I knew it... A secret that only I knew about you...

189
00:26:35,867 --> 00:26:42,567
夜を越えて　遠い思い出の　君が指をさす
Crossing the night, you point your finger in far-away memories...

190
00:26:51,067 --> 00:26:55,867
無邪気な声で
With an innocent voice...

191
00:27:33,247 --> 00:27:36,067
[Title: Broken Wings]

192
00:27:36,067 --> 00:27:40,567
[Text: 作詞：種ともこ 作曲：江口貴勅]
[Text: Lyrics: Tomoko Tane / Music: Takaaki Eguchi]

193
00:27:43,067 --> 00:27:50,267
I know this will not remain forever

194
00:27:50,267 --> 00:27:53,867
However it's beautiful

195
00:27:54,067 --> 00:28:00,567
Your eyes, hands and your warm smile, They're my treasure

196
00:28:01,067 --> 00:28:05,567
It's hard to forget

197
00:28:06,067 --> 00:28:11,567
I wish there was a solution, Don't spend your time in confusion

198
00:28:11,567 --> 00:28:16,567
I'll turn back now and spread my broken wings

199
00:28:17,067 --> 00:28:21,567
still strong enough to cross the ocean with

200
00:28:22,067 --> 00:28:28,267
My broken wings, How far should I go drifting in the wind

201
00:28:28,267 --> 00:28:32,567
Higher and higher in the light

202
00:28:33,067 --> 00:28:36,567
still strong enough to cross the ocean with

203
00:28:37,067 --> 00:28:42,567
My broken wings, How far should I go drifting in the wind

204
00:28:43,067 --> 00:28:51,067
Across the sky, just keep on flying

205
00:29:00,067 --> 00:29:04,567
計測のできない痛みと　計測のできない時間の流れが
Even if unmeasurable pain and unmeasurable passage of time

206
00:29:05,567 --> 00:29:12,567
すべてを埋めてしまおうとしても　それでも私には感じられる
try to bury everything, still I can feel it

207
00:29:14,067 --> 00:29:21,067
空から落ちてくるのは　空から落ちてくるのは　雨ではなくて…
What is falling from the sky, what is falling from the sky is not rain...

208
00:29:24,067 --> 00:29:30,067
Did I ever chain you down to my heart

209
00:29:30,067 --> 00:29:35,067
'Cause I was afraid of you

210
00:29:36,067 --> 00:29:39,567
No, I couldn't hold any longer

211
00:29:39,567 --> 00:29:42,567
Love is not a toy

212
00:29:42,567 --> 00:29:46,567
Let go of me now

213
00:29:47,067 --> 00:29:52,067
The time we spent is perpetual, Our future is not real

214
00:29:53,067 --> 00:29:57,567
so I'll leap into the air

215
00:29:58,067 --> 00:30:03,067
My broken wings, still strong enough to cross the ocean with

216
00:30:04,067 --> 00:30:06,067
My broken wings

217
00:31:26,630 --> 00:31:35,430
見つめてた 臆病な 過去を わがままに 笑って
Smiling selfishly at the cowardly past I used to stare at...

218
00:31:35,830 --> 00:31:44,530
まだ何に 怖がってた? 後ろの自分が現実にうつる
What was I still afraid of? My back reflects onto the present reality.

219
00:31:44,730 --> 00:31:52,430
映すいくつかの 空を描いた ここはきっと 儚い心見出して
Reflecting countless painted skies, here I'm sure I'll find a fleeting heart...

220
00:31:52,730 --> 00:32:00,230
夢で描く どんな 体はどんな 不安まとっても 振り払ってく
Dreaming in my dreams, no matter what anxieties wrap around my body, I'll shake them off.

221
00:32:00,530 --> 00:32:10,730
眠る 小さな 想い 広がり出して 傷弱い私 君がいれば 暗い世界 強く入れた
A small sleeping feeling starts to spread; if you're here with fragile me, I could enter even a dark world strong.

222
00:32:33,330 --> 00:32:39,030
I wanna always be with you. I'll give you everything I have.

223
00:32:39,930 --> 00:32:49,330
探してた 導く 光 触れれば すべて 思い出して 抱き締めのない 大切な 今を
Searching for the guiding light, if I touch it, I remember everything and embrace this precious present...

224
00:32:49,830 --> 00:33:00,830
くれる ねぇ 落とし 世界を 知った それはいつも 温いのに痛くて
Giving... hey, knowing a fallen world, even though it's always warm, it hurts...

225
00:33:01,230 --> 00:33:07,430
繋ぐ 確か な 願い 重なり合って 見える 迷いは 動き始めた
Connecting, sure wishes overlap, and the visible hesitation started to move.

226
00:33:07,730 --> 00:33:14,730
君を守り 手を傷は 深い 眠りの中 漂った
Protecting you, even if my hands are deeply wounded, drifting in a deep sleep...

227
00:33:15,230 --> 00:33:25,030
変わらない 約束だった 二人 信じた 絆は そう 生命に
It was an unchanging promise; the bond we two believed in gave life...

228
00:34:02,830 --> 00:34:14,130
声が 届くまで 名前を 呼んで 出会えた 奇跡 感じたい もっと
