229
00:34:14,430 --> 00:34:25,130
夢で 描く どんな 体は どんな 不安 まどっても 振り払ってく
Dreaming in my dreams, no matter what anxieties wrap around my body, I'll shake them off.

230
00:34:25,430 --> 00:34:36,130
眠る 小さな 想い 広がり出して 傷ついた 僕を 君がいれば 暗い 世界 強く いれた
A small sleeping feeling began to spread; if you were there with wounded me, I could stay strong even in a dark world.

231
00:34:36,430 --> 00:34:47,130
永い 夢見る この 心は そう 永遠で
This heart dreaming an eternal dream is truly forever...

