279
00:46:05,139 --> 00:46:12,139
獅白ぼたんなりの音楽を存分に感じてもらえる1枚になっているかなと思いますので、ぜひよろしくお願いします。
I think it's an album where you can fully feel Shishiro Botan's unique musical style, so I hope you'll check it out!

280
00:46:12,139 --> 00:46:19,139
そして、アルバムゲットしてくれた皆さんに感謝の気持ちを込めて、全員に直筆サイン入りのグッズも用意していますので、
And to show our gratitude to everyone who gets the album, we've prepared goods with handwritten signatures for everyone, so—

281
00:46:19,139 --> 00:46:28,139
そのほかたくさん、ここでしか手に入らないこだわりグッズ詰め込んでますので、ぜひ詳細は公式ページをチェックしていただけたら嬉しいです。
We've packed it with plenty of other special goods you can only get right here, so we'd be thrilled if you check out the official page for details!

282
00:46:29,139 --> 00:46:34,139
本当におめでとうございます！ありがとうございます！
Huge congratulations! Thank you so much!

283
00:46:34,139 --> 00:46:46,139
このアルバムはですね、ホロライブ公式オンラインショップでこのあと予約開始となります。がんばって作ったファーストアルバムなので、たくさんの人に手に取ってもらえると嬉しいです。
This album will be available for pre-order on the Hololive Official Online Shop right after this. Since I worked hard to make this 1st album, I'd be so happy if as many people as possible pick it up!

284
00:46:46,139 --> 00:46:57,139
そしてですね、まだあるんですよ、実は。ラストのこのお知らせ、結構重大発表なので、こちらご覧ください。ドン！
And you know, there's still more actually. This final announcement is a pretty major reveal, so please take a look at this. Bam!

285
00:46:58,139 --> 00:47:06,139
[Text: 緊急告知！！獅白ぼたん 特殊なオフイベ開催決定！]
[Text: Urgent Announcement!! Shishiro Botan Special Offline Event Confirmed!]

286
00:47:06,139 --> 00:47:16,139
ということで、2027年2月末から3月中旬あけておいてね！
So mark your calendars from late February to mid-March 2027!

287
00:47:16,139 --> 00:47:25,139
長くなくて、1日じゃないよ！ということで、皆さんぜひ楽しみにしといてもらえたら嬉しいなと思ってます。
Not the whole time, it's not just one single day! So I hope everyone is looking forward to it.

288
00:47:25,139 --> 00:47:37,139
気になる、気になる、ネポラボの、ネポラボの皆さんもずっとね、来てほしいなと思いつつ、
I'm curious... NePoLaBo members too have been wanting you guys to come...

289
00:47:37,139 --> 00:47:54,139
なんか、まだ内緒だけどね。遊びに来てほしいかなって感じ。楽しみにしててね、全力で楽しませちゃうよ！
Well, it's still a secret though. I'd love for you to come play. Look forward to it, I'll make sure you have the absolute best time!

290
00:47:55,139 --> 00:48:15,139
2月末から3月中旬予定となっておりますので、ぜひ情報会禁色々またしていくので、チェックよろしくお願いします！
It's scheduled from late February to mid-March, so we'll be rolling out information gradually, please check it out!

291
00:48:15,139 --> 00:48:38,139
そして、ネポラボのみんなもこの後一緒に歌わせてもいただきますので、ネポラボの皆さんぜひ楽しみに待っててください。あと、メンギアンコールライブもね、今日ありますので、ぜひそちらも来ていただけたら嬉しいです。
And NePoLaBo will also be singing together with me after this, so NePoLaBo members, please look forward to it! Also, there's a NePoLaBo encore live today, so we'd love for you to come to that too!

292
00:48:38,139 --> 00:48:44,139
じゃあ私ちょっと次の曲、一緒に着替えるんで、みんなちょっと繋いでおいてもらっていいですか。
Well then, I'm going to go change into my next outfit, so could you guys keep things going for a moment?

293
00:48:44,139 --> 00:49:28,139
繋いでおく？獅白の特殊なオフイベ予想をしよう。
Keep things going? Let's guess about Shishiro's special offline event!

294
00:49:28,139 --> 00:49:44,639
ということで、ネポラボともね、この後歌うんですが、まずはちょっと次の曲、私の新曲を聞いて頂きたいと思いますので、ぜひ聞いてください。それでは、「Stray & Stay」。
And so, NePoLaBo and I will be singing together after this, but first, I'd like you all to listen to my new song, "Stray & Stay". Please give it a listen.

295
00:50:01,388 --> 00:50:03,808
Losing the faint light,

296
00:50:04,828 --> 00:50:10,608
形のない、夜に沈む知覚の様、
Like shapeless perception sinking into the night,

297
00:50:11,408 --> 00:50:14,948
不安な位相が走る思考、から落ちた記憶を
Thoughts racing with unstable phase, dropping memories out of nowhere,

298
00:50:15,368 --> 00:50:18,708
昨日と同じ軌道を日更に散らばった重なり合った視覚を
And overlapping visions scattered daily along the same orbit as yesterday.

299
00:50:19,028 --> 00:50:22,568
Stay, Stay, Stay in my own place. Stay, Without a trace.

300
00:50:22,788 --> 00:50:29,768
ぐちゃぐちゃになった言葉が、消えてしまう前に、
Before the scrambled words fade away,

301
00:50:31,808 --> 00:50:36,088
掴みたいと願った、
I wished to grasp them,

302
00:50:36,488 --> 00:50:41,148
ただ繰り返した、ただ繰り返した、
Just repeating, just repeating...

303
00:50:41,828 --> 00:50:51,228
ただ繰り返して、ただ繰り返して、ただ繰り返して、また繰り返して…
Just repeating, just repeating, just repeating, repeating again...

304
00:50:51,608 --> 00:50:54,028
まだ、離さないでいて。
Still, don't let me go.

305
00:51:21,068 --> 00:51:23,508
Waking from a shallow sleep,

306
00:51:24,448 --> 00:51:30,128
形のない、夜に沈む知覚の様、
Like shapeless perception sinking into the night,

307
00:51:31,028 --> 00:51:34,748
未完成な鼓動、またも轟くが如くを
Incomplete heartbeat, roaring once again as if echoing,

308
00:51:35,028 --> 00:51:40,648
冠する衝動と同じ過去を辿る、さらに透き通れれど見えぬものを
Pursuing the same past as the impulse crowning it, seeking something transparent yet invisible.

309
00:51:40,788 --> 00:51:44,068
Sway, Sway, Sway out of place. Sway, Fading away.

310
00:51:44,428 --> 00:51:50,528
ぐちゃぐちゃになった言葉が、色褪せる前に、
Before the scrambled words lose their color,

311
00:51:54,008 --> 00:51:58,608
描き留めたいと思った、
I thought I wanted to capture and hold them,

312
00:51:59,448 --> 00:52:12,648
ただ繰り返した、ただ繰り返した…また繰り返して、また繰り返して、また繰り返して…
Just repeating, just repeating... repeating again, repeating again, repeating again...

313
00:52:13,028 --> 00:52:15,288
まだ、忘れないでいて。
Still, don't forget.

314
00:53:05,846 --> 00:53:11,286
共に限界まで張り巡る迷宮は Are you ready? Fight!
Labyrinths stretching to the limit together, Are you ready? Fight!

315
00:53:16,806 --> 00:53:21,286
Lala... Rurila...

316
00:53:26,726 --> 00:53:31,326
何度泥沼踏みに這いずり土を噛んだって
No matter how many times we crawl through the mud and bite the dirt,

317
00:53:31,746 --> 00:53:37,266
先も寄り合い背を託す 戦場に咲く友がいる
Supporting each other and entrusting our backs, there are friends blooming on the battlefield.

318
00:53:37,446 --> 00:53:41,986
ガチンコでシャハな時も 何故か立ち向かえる
Even in serious and harsh times, for some reason we can face it head-on.

319
00:53:42,146 --> 00:53:47,266
スフォルツァンドの限界まで フォルテロ銀河に溺れよ
To the limit of sforzando, let's drown in the fortissimo galaxy!

320
00:53:47,546 --> 00:53:55,586
Burn, burn, burn, burn, burn, burn! ブルッたって突き出せる Burn, burn, burn, burn, burn, burn!
Burn, burn, burn, burn, burn, burn! Trembling, we can still push forward! Burn, burn, burn, burn, burn, burn!

321
00:53:55,866 --> 00:53:57,986
例え凍て和雪に絞れ
Even if frozen and choked by snow,

322
00:53:58,066 --> 00:54:02,746
人が作る想いの答えを信じよ
Believe in the answer of feelings created by people!

323
00:54:02,886 --> 00:54:07,386
ハートを震わせて 相手殴れ 100度負けても
Make your heart tremble, strike your opponent down, even if we lose 100 times,

324
00:54:07,826 --> 00:54:11,226
101度目に笑ってる この力とは？
We'll be smiling on the 101st time. What is this power?

325
00:54:13,946 --> 00:54:17,506
誰もが紡ぐ歌の響きだ 交わる勇気 確かめ合って
It is the resonance of songs spun by everyone, confirming our intersecting courage.

326
00:54:20,726 --> 00:54:25,826
Never give up! さあ夜明けへと 怖さも涙も ちぎって分け合い
Never give up! Now toward the dawn, tearing apart and sharing both fear and tears,

327
00:54:28,706 --> 00:54:31,026
勝利を掴め！
Seize victory!

328
00:54:46,006 --> 00:54:50,746
握れば握るほどまた 開く意味を知り
The more we grip, the more we learn the meaning of opening anew,

329
00:54:51,086 --> 00:54:56,466
相手の傷が伝わり 無刀の極みへ焦がれる
Feeling the opponent's wounds, yearning for the pinnacle of swordsmanship without a blade.

330
00:54:56,726 --> 00:55:03,126
因縁の連鎖にこそ 撃鉄を起こせ ――レクイエムじゃなく奏で合ったら？
Within the chain of fate, pull the trigger -- rather than a requiem, what if we played together?

331
00:55:04,138 --> 00:55:06,258
オレの知らないぬくもりが
A warmth I never knew...

332
00:55:06,798 --> 00:55:09,038
誰かの思い出の中
...lives on inside someone's memories?

333
00:55:09,378 --> 00:55:11,758
生きているのだとしたなら?
If that's the case...

334
00:55:12,138 --> 00:55:14,518
完全否定以外にも
Besides complete denial,

335
00:55:14,758 --> 00:55:16,658
異なる道があるんだと
there must be another path.

336
00:55:17,138 --> 00:55:19,618
だから絶対 この手と
That's why I will never let go of this hand...

337
00:55:19,918 --> 00:55:21,958
不器用なこの手は
This clumsy hand of mine

338
00:55:22,198 --> 00:55:26,358
差し伸べる祈りを忘れはしない
will never forget the prayer I extend.

339
00:55:27,218 --> 00:55:29,998
だから戦え 痛みを抱き
So fight on, embracing the pain,

340
00:55:30,238 --> 00:55:32,858
分かり合えるそうぶち込めよ
and pour it all in to truly understand each other!

341
00:55:33,058 --> 00:55:36,418
みんなが歌ううたの願いが
The wish of the song everyone sings together

342
00:55:37,138 --> 00:55:40,078
重なる勇気 許す勇気
is the courage to unite, the courage to forgive.

343
00:55:40,238 --> 00:55:42,798
Never Give Up さあ前進だ
Never Give Up! Now, push forward!

344
00:55:43,058 --> 00:55:47,698
善も悪もごった煮の世界を愛せ
Love this mixed-up world of both good and evil!

345
00:55:48,118 --> 00:55:52,298
世界を愛せ！
Love the world!

346
00:55:53,978 --> 00:55:55,778
大好きな歌の中なら
If it's inside my favorite song,

347
00:55:55,918 --> 00:55:58,358
声にしてもいいのかな
can I give voice to my feelings?

348
00:55:58,538 --> 00:56:00,838
思い出が強さになった
Memories have turned into strength;

349
00:56:01,078 --> 00:56:03,358
君ならば歌えるはず
if it's you, you should be able to sing.

350
00:56:03,738 --> 00:56:06,098
過去という過去が生まれて
Past after past is born,

351
00:56:06,258 --> 00:56:10,058
未来にはどう描くんだ
how will we sketch our future?

352
00:56:11,018 --> 00:56:14,598
心からオレは「ありがとう」を
From the bottom of my heart, I want to say "Thank you"

353
00:56:14,858 --> 00:56:17,718
歌ってあげたいんだ
and sing it out to you!

354
00:56:45,158 --> 00:56:48,318
100度負けても101度目に
Even if we lose a hundred times, on the 101st time

355
00:56:48,478 --> 00:56:51,398
笑える この力とは
we'll laugh. What is this power?

356
00:56:51,718 --> 00:56:55,438
みんなで繋いだ うたのひびきだ！
It's the resonance of the song we all connected together!

357
00:56:55,778 --> 00:56:58,278
交わる勇気 託し合って
Courage that intersects, entrusting each other,

358
00:56:58,618 --> 00:57:01,278
Never Give Up さあ夜明けへの
Never Give Up! Now, towards the dawn,

359
00:57:01,578 --> 00:57:03,998
始まりを吠え歌え
howl and sing the beginning!

360
00:57:04,158 --> 00:57:08,158
X-BRAVERS 勝利を掴め！
X-BRAVERS, seize victory!

